{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Finalize shutdown-time scope fatals with the actual status.** This check can first observe a fatal after `onInvocationEnd` emitted `PENDING`/`SUCCEEDED` and manager closure released the plugins. Lambda then retries while OTel/Insight have permanently flushed a stale outcome. Keep plugins available through the final pre-response fatal check, then dispatch once with `RETRYING` and the fatal before releasing them.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc75xCP8","finding_digest":"8be69537d7226d4ace1dfef289a46b28f9e5175206d90fffc1bd85e48ff10825","finding_id":"arf_v1_rptjkn6xejwuvtq573zitjdlfd","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-finalization-bypass","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-finalization-bypass","line":286,"observation_digest":"f68491b956ce01166bde1cc77bf39bd83052f98504cf3e8c093f3a4ab506ca50","observation_id":"aro_v1_62cjdokwzyarm266dtdxx4433a","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rptjkn6xejwuvtq573zitjdlfd","published_at":"2026-10-06T00:45:25Z","review_id":"arr_v1_523fpro2dldye6ezvg2q6x7mrp","reviewed_base_sha":"ac6a6f5ea50d6a9098b716905f01c609e4c201ae","reviewed_head_sha":"e6a6d94fc7b34a020f2b5b8dbf1100d2be12e08b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":286,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_ilkc3vg2kbu3egy76owgzd65sh","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-06T00:45:25Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
